115
00:08:40,820 --> 00:08:42,820
I need to put an end to this.

116
00:08:42,820 --> 00:08:45,820
But do you really understand what that means?

117
00:08:45,820 --> 00:08:52,820
Before this is all over, you may have to kill your own mother.

118
00:08:54,820 --> 00:08:57,820
