136
00:09:57,820 --> 00:09:58,820
I'm here to...

137
00:09:58,820 --> 00:10:15,820
I'm here to help someone who's important to me.

138
00:10:18,820 --> 00:10:20,820
Someone who's been there for me no matter what.

139
00:10:20,820 --> 00:10:23,820
I'm here to... I'm here to stop you, Medusa.

140
00:10:23,820 --> 00:10:24,820
How disappointing.

141
00:10:27,820 --> 00:10:29,820
After all I've done, I expected better from you.

142
00:10:30,820 --> 00:10:32,820
Are you sure you won't reconsider?

143
00:10:33,820 --> 00:10:34,820
He's sure. Accept it.

144
00:10:35,820 --> 00:10:36,820
This is hopeless, you know.

145
00:10:37,820 --> 00:10:40,820
No matter what you try, the two of you don't have enough power to hurt me.

146
00:10:41,820 --> 00:10:43,820
