172
00:12:26,820 --> 00:12:27,820
Mizunez!

173
00:12:28,820 --> 00:12:30,820
Right. Everything on Free's end is still the same.

174
00:12:31,820 --> 00:12:34,820
I understand. Let me know if there are any changes.

175
00:12:37,820 --> 00:12:40,820
Medusa gets to watch all this from the comfort of her home.

176
00:12:41,820 --> 00:12:45,820
