204
00:14:28,820 --> 00:14:30,820
He isn't trying to hurt me.

205
00:14:31,820 --> 00:14:33,820
Which means they must have some other strategy.

206
00:14:34,820 --> 00:14:35,820
Vector Arrow!

207
00:14:43,820 --> 00:14:45,820
It's not too late to stop this, Krona.

208
00:14:45,820 --> 00:14:49,820
I'm tired of hating myself all the time.

209
00:14:50,820 --> 00:14:54,820
And I'm tired of betraying the people I care about.

210
00:14:56,820 --> 00:15:01,820
Most of all, I'm tired of being some tool for you to use.

211
00:15:02,820 --> 00:15:03,820
Poor Krona.

212
00:15:06,820 --> 00:15:08,820
Do you even know what you're saying?

213
00:15:09,820 --> 00:15:11,820
You'll always be mine, nothing can change that.

214
00:15:12,820 --> 00:15:13,820
No, no, you're wrong!

215
00:15:13,820 --> 00:15:16,820
You're really still a good little kid, aren't you?

216
00:15:17,820 --> 00:15:18,820
I'm not!

217
