224
00:15:39,820 --> 00:15:40,820
After all...

225
00:15:40,820 --> 00:15:45,820
No matter what's happening...

226
00:15:46,820 --> 00:15:51,820
You're still my child.

227
00:15:52,820 --> 00:15:53,820
I don't care!

228
00:15:54,820 --> 00:15:55,820
